    <data name="PricingFaq2Question" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>What counts as a room?</value>
    </data>
    <data name="PricingFaq2Answer" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Every unit you sell by the night: rooms, apartments or dorm beds sold as one unit. Rooms that are out of order still count.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="PricingFaq3Question" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Do you take a commission on bookings?</value>
    </data>
    <data name="PricingFaq3Answer" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Never. The booking engine and the channel manager are part of the plan price, however many nights you sell.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="PricingFaq4Question" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Can we change plans or room count later?</value>
    </data>
    <data name="PricingFaq4Answer" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Yes, from one month to the next. Adding rooms takes effect at once; going down to a smaller plan takes effect at the next bill.</value>
